OL,3,ADrug deaths rise sharply in Scotland as
OL,4,Afigures remain worst in Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeaths related to illicit drugs rose by
OL,7,F11% in Scotland last year to 1,133 as
OL,8,Fthe country struggles to tackle the
OL,9,Fworst fatality rate in Europe.
OL,11,FNational Records of Scotland (NRS) said
OL,12,Fthe figure for 2025 was 116 higher than
OL,13,Fthe previous year, bringing the total
OL,14,Fdeaths in a decade to more than 11,000.
OL,16,FAfter adjusting for age, there were 214
OL,17,Fdrug-related deaths per million people.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
